## Qualification boundary

The README defines this as completed offscreen WARP rendering with no swap-chain presentation or vsync. It does not measure the WindowHost UIA snapshot/token path or presented FPS, and it does not qualify ARM64. Do not use unchanged UIA-path behavior to claim causal absence of UIA cost. The present sidecars support numeric comparison only while driver restoration remains pending.
